## redis.conf.template

## Network and security
bind 0.0.0.0
port ${ARG_REDIS_PORT}
protected-mode yes
requirepass ${ARG_REDIS_PASSWORD}
timeout 0
tcp-keepalive 300

## Memory and limiting
save ""
appendonly no
maxmemory 128mb
maxmemory-policy noeviction

## Execution and logging 
daemonize no
supervised no
loglevel warning

## Note: Dangerous commands are disabled
rename-command FLUSHDB ""
rename-command FLUSHALL ""
rename-command CONFIG ""
rename-command DEBUG ""
rename-command SHUTDOWN ""
